  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="0bdb1b35-0352-4b50-bb3f-19b160395d83"><problem><para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 3, factor.</para>
      <para>\(u^2 − 9u + 18\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((u + 9)(u + 2)\)</para><para>\((u − 3)(u − 6)\)</para><para>\((u + 3)(u + 6)\)</para><para>\((u + 3)(u − 6)\)</para></problem><solution><para>\((u − 3)(u − 6)\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \((u − 3)(u − 6)\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
